# Xcode
DeepSink/build/
DeepSink/DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad/
xcuserdata/
.DS_Store

# Nothing else needed: no Secrets.swift-style file exists — the router URL
# and bearer token are entered in-app (Settings) and live in UserDefaults/
# Keychain on-device, never in source. This is what keeps the repo itself
# fully sufficient to clone-and-build on a different Mac (see
# install_to_deepsink_device.sh's own comment on statelessness).
